1. Purpose

Event-Wedding-01 is a polished five-page wedding and event planning website for Amaranth & Oak.

It is a frontend-only V1 showcase and lead-generation website.

The site is designed to communicate:

wedding and event planning services

signature event experiences

venue/style capabilities

visual portfolio work

testimonials

direct contact and enquiry options

This V1 intentionally does not require a backend, database, authentication system, online payments, or an admin panel.

