5. Image Architecture

All physical images live in:

public/images/

The centralized image registry is:

src/data/images.js

The project uses the rule:

Physical image
      ↓
public/images/
      ↓
src/data/images.js
      ↓
data / sections / pages
      ↓
components
      ↓
browser

Single-source image rule

Do not create multiple physical copies of the same photograph merely because the photo is used in different sections.

One physical image can be referenced by hero, event cards, venue presentation, gallery, homepage preview, and other appropriate sections.

