8. Image Replacement Rule

For a normal image replacement:

Prefer keeping the existing filename.

Replace the physical file inside public/images/.

Keep the corresponding registry entry.

Keep meaningful alt text.

Verify the image on all affected pages.

Avoid unstable names such as final.jpg, new-final.jpg, copy.jpg, or test.jpg.

