13. Responsive Requirements

The website must remain usable at approximately:

290px
320px
360px
390px
430px
768px
1024px
1280px
1440px

Maintain:

no unintended horizontal scrolling

images inside their containers

appropriate grid collapse

usable buttons/touch targets

natural heading wrapping

clean mobile forms

usable navigation/drawer

viewport-safe modal/lightbox content

no clipped text

When using CSS Grid, prefer safe structures such as:

grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));

and use min-width: 0, max-width: 100%, and box-sizing: border-box where appropriate.

Do not use overflow-x: hidden as the only fix for structural overflow.

14. Accessibility

Maintain meaningful image alt text, keyboard-usable controls, focus states where appropriate, semantic headings, buttons for actions, links for navigation, adequate contrast, usable touch targets, and reduced-motion consideration where appropriate.

15. Styling and Maintenance

