17. Image QA

List physical image files:

find public/images -maxdepth 1 -type f -printf '%f\n' | sort

Check source references:

grep -RInE '(/images/|images\.)' src \\
  --include='*.js' \\
  --include='*.jsx'

For every referenced physical image, confirm the matching file exists in public/images/.

A successful Vite build does not by itself prove that every runtime image reference is visually correct, so perform a browser check too.

